`@11thdeg/lys` 1.2.1 build at commit
`116d76255c42d5bb2a78de3954462b89979688f1`.

Upstream: https://github.com/villetakanen/lys

The upstream package and README declare MIT licensing. That checkout does not
contain a standalone LICENSE file; this notice records the upstream declaration
and source provenance. Preserve it with the bundled runtime.

The build embeds these files in `examples/kata-lys.html` for offline use.
Updating the runtime is a deliberate copy-and-review operation, not part of the
normal example build.
